(12,'2023-05-13 10:56:23',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Site Engineer / Project Engineer',NULL,'Huawei Tech Investment, PT.','2012-04-09 17:00:00','2023-05-12 17:00:00',133,'true','Banten Area – Indonesia. (April, 10th 2012 – Present) 3 months contract extendable. Scope of works : \n-Coordination and Monitoring TI Sub Contractor Activity for Material On Site (MOS), Installation BTS 2G/3G and MW, Integration until Acceptance Test (ATP) done. \n-Regular Monitoring and reporting regarding Monthly Target for TI Subconts, Access Permit will be expired, Access Issue and TI activity as required base on contract. \n-Involved for Troubleshooting activity if problem appeared. \n-Supervise installation and did commissioning for 2G and 3G huawei BTS DBS 3900A, BTS 3900 indoor and outdoor. \n-Process Escalation if any problem appeared on site like Power Issue, CME not RFI, Stolen Issue, cross feeder, Faulty Material and communicate well with others department. \n-Migration Microwave to Hybrid Networking (Native E1 and IP) and IP Networking for Axis AMBER Project, Jakarta, Indonesia. \n-Supervise and control sub contractors to do installation to make sure meet the customer requirements. \n-Conduct ATP 2G, 3G, and MW onsite with subconts and customers. \n-Communicate with other departments and vendors (Customer Service, Marketing, Sales, Implementation, Operation, and other) for network quality improvement initiatives or problem coordination and control. \n-Conduct for produce daily, weekly, monthly and other reporting to Management about network quality level. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','7UPMF',NULL,NULL,NULL),
