(16,'2023-05-13 10:56:23',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Project Engineer for renewable',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Scope of works : \n•Site Survey and PhotoVoltaic system Simulation \n-Responsible for making Site Survey for Solar Cell Implementation \n-Collected some parameter for solarcell design such sun radiation (W/m2) using Solarimeter, Wind (m/s) and Temperature (°C) using Anemometer. \n-Measurement capacity load needed for Solar Cell like load ampere and load voltage. \n-Designed engineering using PVsyst 5 as simulation for solar cell placement and measurement. \n-Conduct for fabrication fix system equipment from designed PV module, junction box, MCB needed, arrester, Outback SCC, inverter DC to AC, configure NMS via sms and designed battery backup system. \n•Packaging and Delivery \n-Conduct for material packaging and delivery using local expedition. \n-Monitoring delivery material with local expedition until received by installation team. \n•Supervise installation, commissioning, integration and acceptance test \n-Checking site installation regarding Civil Work, Mechanical and Electrical activities. \n-Testing and commissioning Solar Charge Controller with PV module. \n-Integration Existing equipment by connecting DC voltage from SCC to rectifier existing. \n-Acceptance test with customer after integration finished. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','NG4XB',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(17,'2023-05-13 10:56:23',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Assistant PM for Modernization',NULL,'','2011-03-31 17:00:00','2011-06-30 17:00:00',3,'false','Interface Telkomsel Sumbagteng Area. ( April 1 st 2011 – July 2011) Scope of works : \n•BSC Flexi3i and TCSM3i Installation Supervisor \n-Check Installation of BSC Flexi3i and TCSM3i according to Technical Site Survey Report (TSSR). \n-Support testing E1 transmission for Re-homing and Re-parenting activity. \n-Conduct for Ater/Abis and A if interface installation and x-connection before Re-homing and Re-parenting. \n-Conduct for BTS 2G Flexi Multi Radio (FMR) DCS installation, hotswap and commissioning activity. \n-Support for Transmission Survey and Reporting E1 availability to Transmission Planning Division. \n-Routine checking material in warehouse Padang for make sure database valid. \n-Arrange team subcontractor for Material on Site and starting installation activity at the site. \n•Transmission Preparation for Modernization Gemini Project Plan \n-Coordination with transmission Planning/TNP for execution x connection as customer plan for TRX upgrade, new or collocated FMR, change drop insert to star configuration, etc \n-Made Transmission Preparation for Re-homing activity which starting middle of the night. \n-Coordination with Tsel Operator for starting Re-homing activity from Siemens BSC HC120 to Flexi BSC3i \n-Execution moving transmission from existing Siemens Slim Rack to new FBSC slim rack during rehoming. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','NIMX8',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(18,'2023-05-13 10:56:23',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Coordinator of Manage Service',NULL,'SIEMENS INDONESIA','2010-03-06 17:00:00','2011-03-06 17:00:00',12,'false','•Huawei – AXIS NTS Manage Service Project for West Java Area. \n-Received Trouble Ticket from NOC Axis then escalated the problem to cluster engineer for performed troubleshooting. Siemens Indonesia, PT Noviacom – Riyadh – KSA (www.noviacom.net) ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','UHHLJ',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(19,'2023-05-13 10:56:23',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'I& C (Installation & Commissioning) Supervisor',NULL,'','2006-05-31 17:00:00','2010-02-28 17:00:00',45,'false','Hutchinson CAROENK POKPHAN Telecommunication /HCPT – SIEMENS Projects in Indonesia SIEMENS by consultant for Java and Bali region. ( June 2006 to March 2010) Scope of works : \n•BTS SIEMENS BR241, BR82 Installation & Commissioning Supervisor Check Installation of SIEMENS BTS for BR241, BR82 according to site binder. Arrange material request from the Warehouse for Installation. Power up BTS hardware and Commissioning BTS Software for 3 phase, setting PCM-B, LAPDL-A for star or multi drop depend on timeslot, Configuration Cell like DUVSWR, DULNA and FCU as well as semi rigid installed each sector, setting ENVA for external alarm like Mains Failure, OBL Failure and Arrester Failure and made necessary testing with NOC. Acceptance test (ATP) with Managed Service and fill up the binder for documentation like ATMN MW, BTS for signed Receive trouble Ticket from NOC/MS during Site not Accepted to troubleshoot (Bs288,Bs241,Service Rack, Network Problem) \n-Conduct for commissioning software like default setting hardware IDU, Frequency TX and Rx, E1 capacity belongs to memory Key, IP address setting as DCN planning. \n-Conduct for alignment and capture the result of RSL. \n-Conduct for ATMN doc like Transmission Capture, interference test, BER Test, MW Inventory and report to Implementation Manager. \n-Conduct also for receive trouble ticket from NOC and made necessary troubleshoot at the sites. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','XPJLM',NULL,NULL,NULL),
